"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">42</div><h1>수동의 확장과 대체 표현</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Passiv im Konjunktiv II, bekommen-Passiv und Passiversatz</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 42의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>C1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 · 보강 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">수동문을 접속법 II로 말해요 — würde … · wäre … worden</div><div class=\"x-goal\">'~됐어야 했다 · ~될 수 있었다'를 hätte … werden müssen · können으로 말해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">bekommen 수동으로 받는 사람을 주어로 세워요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">수동문을 sich lassen · sein … zu · -bar · bleiben … zu · es gilt … zu로 바꿔요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"e6a8db5b14\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Wenn wir mehr Personal hätten, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> die Anträge schneller bearbeitet.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) hätten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) werden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) wären</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) würden</button></div><div class=\"qe\">지금의 가정을 수동으로 말하면 würde + 과거분사예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e03ee7496a\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Ohne den Hinweis der Nachbarin <span class=\"qblank\"></span> der Brand erst viel später entdeckt worden.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) hätte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) wäre</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) würde</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) wird</button></div><div class=\"qe\">지난 일의 가정을 수동으로 말하면 wäre + 과거분사 + worden이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5cadccdc57\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Die Straße hätte schon letztes Jahr repariert werden <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) müsste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) musste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) gemusst</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) müssen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">hätte + 과거분사 + werden + 화법조동사 원형. 완료형에서 화법조동사는 원형으로 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9012c441ea\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Zum Geburtstag <span class=\"qblank\"></span> sie von ihrer Abteilung einen Reiseführer geschenkt.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) hat</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) war</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) bekam</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) wurde</button></div><div class=\"qe\">받는 사람(sie)이 주어면 bekommen + 과거분사를 써요. Man schenkte ihr einen Reiseführer와 뜻이 같아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"2c439a63b5\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Der Fleck <span class=\"qblank\"></span> sich mit Wasser entfernen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) ist</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) kann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) wird</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) lässt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sich lassen + 원형 = ~될 수 있다. Der Fleck kann mit Wasser entfernt werden과 뜻이 같아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5f86e0d220\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Die Hausarbeiten <span class=\"qblank\"></span> bis zum 15. Mai abzugeben.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) sind</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) haben</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) werden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) lassen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sein … zu + 원형 = ~되어야 한다. Die Hausarbeiten müssen abgegeben werden과 뜻이 같아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"40843db1bb\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;worden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Der Termin wäre beinahe vergessen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(수동의 완료형)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 약속은 하마터면 잊힐 뻔했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Termin wäre beinahe vergessen <b>worden</b>.</div>수동의 werden은 완료형에서 worden이에요. geworden은 '~이 되다'일 때만 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c902aafc99\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;würde&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Wenn es mehr Parkplätze gäbe, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(수동 · 접속법 II)</span> das Zentrum öfter besucht.</div><div class=\"qko\">주차장이 더 있다면 사람들이 시내를 더 자주 찾을 텐데요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wenn es mehr Parkplätze gäbe, <b>würde</b> das Zentrum öfter besucht.</div>지금의 가정 → würde + 과거분사(besucht).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"70308de460\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;können&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Der Streit hätte vermieden werden <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(~수 있었다 · 원형)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 다툼은 피할 수 있었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Streit hätte vermieden werden <b>können</b>.</div>hätte + 과거분사 + werden + können. 화법조동사는 원형으로 맨 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d275606f36\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bekomme&quot;,&quot;erhalte&quot;,&quot;kriege&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Man schickt mir die Rechnung per Post.<br>→ Ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(받다)</span> die Rechnung per Post geschickt.</div><div class=\"qko\">저는 계산서를 우편으로 받아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Man schickt mir die Rechnung per Post.<br>→ Ich <b>bekomme</b> die Rechnung per Post geschickt.</div>3격 mir가 주어 ich가 되고, bekommen + 과거분사를 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5cf6c7033d\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sich&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Der Termin kann nicht verschoben werden.<br>→ Der Termin lässt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(재귀대명사)</span> nicht verschieben.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 약속은 미룰 수 없어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Termin kann nicht verschoben werden.<br>→ Der Termin lässt <b>sich</b> nicht verschieben.</div>sich lassen + 원형이 한 덩어리예요. sich를 빼면 안 돼요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"39194f62e7\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;zu&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Die Tür kann nicht geöffnet werden.<br>→ Die Tür ist nicht <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> öffnen.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 문은 열 수 없어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Tür kann nicht geöffnet werden.<br>→ Die Tür ist nicht <b>zu</b> öffnen.</div>sein … zu + 원형은 '될 수 있다'도 나타내요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"99488829f1\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bar&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Der Arzt kann jederzeit erreicht werden.<br>→ Der Arzt ist jederzeit erreich<input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(접미사)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 의사는 언제든 연락이 돼요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Arzt kann jederzeit erreicht werden.<br>→ Der Arzt ist jederzeit erreich<b>bar</b>.</div>동사 어간 + -bar = ~될 수 있는. erreichen → erreichbar.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"aa86016da8\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;durch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Die Brücke wurde <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(원인 · 4격)</span> ein Hochwasser zerstört.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 다리는 홍수로 무너졌어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Brücke wurde <b>durch</b> ein Hochwasser zerstört.</div>원인과 수단은 durch + 4격으로 말해요. von + 3격은 일을 한 사람에게 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"1942dd0569\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Rechnung hätte längst bezahlt werden müssen&quot;,&quot;Längst hätte die Rechnung bezahlt werden müssen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 계산서는 진작 냈어야 했어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">bezahlt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">werden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">hätte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Rechnung</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">müssen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">längst</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Rechnung hätte längst bezahlt werden müssen.</b></div>hätte가 두 번째, 끝에는 과거분사 → werden → müssen 순서로 쌓아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5d5acd19e8\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir bekommen die Fahrtkosten von der Firma erstattet&quot;,&quot;Von der Firma bekommen wir die Fahrtkosten erstattet&quot;,&quot;Die Fahrtkosten bekommen wir von der Firma erstattet&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 회사에서 교통비를 돌려받아요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">bekommen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Fahrtkosten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">erstattet</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">von</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Firma</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir bekommen die Fahrtkosten von der Firma erstattet.</b></div>bekommen 수동이에요. Die Firma erstattet uns die Fahrtkosten의 3격 uns가 주어 wir가 됐어요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"c48c1ee7d2\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Ich finde, dass die Eltern früher <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) hätten gefragt werden müssen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) hätten gefragt worden müssen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) gefragt hätten werden müssen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) gefragt werden müssen hätten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">종속절에서도 hätte는 끝에 가지 않아요. 원형 두 개(werden müssen)가 이어지면 동사 묶음의 맨 앞에 서요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7feab13903\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> 'Die Sicherheitsvorschriften müssen beachtet werden.'와 뜻이 같은 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Die Sicherheitsvorschriften lassen sich beachten.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) Die Sicherheitsvorschriften sind beachtbar.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Die Sicherheitsvorschriften bekommen beachtet.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) Die Sicherheitsvorschriften sind zu beachten.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'되어야 한다'는 sein … zu로 바꿔요. sich lassen과 -bar는 '될 수 있다'예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"a8d26140ed\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> 수동문으로 바꿀 수 없는 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Die Köchin bereitet das Essen zu.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Das Paket wiegt drei Kilo.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Die Lehrerin erklärt die Regel.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Man baut hier ein Hotel.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">wiegen · kosten · haben · kennen 같은 동사는 수동으로 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"8e6025dc6c\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;angeboten&quot;],[&quot;bekommen&quot;,&quot;erhalten&quot;,&quot;gekriegt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Man hat ihr die Stelle angeboten.<br>→ Sie hat die Stelle <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(anbieten · 과거분사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(받다 · 과거분사)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 그 자리를 제안받았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Man hat ihr die Stelle angeboten.<br>→ Sie hat die Stelle <b>angeboten</b> <b>bekommen</b>.</div>bekommen 수동의 완료형은 과거분사 + bekommen이에요. 3격 ihr가 주어 sie가 돼요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"0e14e56f90\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bleibt&quot;,&quot;ist&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Dieser Punkt muss noch geprüft werden.<br>→ Dieser Punkt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(동사)</span> noch zu prüfen.</div><div class=\"qko\">이 점은 아직 검토해야 해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Dieser Punkt muss noch geprüft werden.<br>→ Dieser Punkt <b>bleibt</b> noch zu prüfen.</div>'아직 되어야 한다'는 bleiben … zu로 말해요. sein … zu도 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d6335d17b7\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gilt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Zuerst müssen die Ursachen geklärt werden.<br>→ Zuerst <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(동사)</span> es, die Ursachen zu klären.</div><div class=\"qko\">먼저 원인을 밝혀야 해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Zuerst müssen die Ursachen geklärt werden.<br>→ Zuerst <b>gilt</b> es, die Ursachen zu klären.</div>es gilt, … zu + 원형 = ~해야 한다. 글에서 쓰는 표현이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"896758d3b8\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;unvermeidbar&quot;,&quot;unvermeidlich&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Diese Kosten können nicht vermieden werden.<br>→ Diese Kosten sind <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:15ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(vermeiden → 형용사)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">이 비용은 피할 수 없어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Diese Kosten können nicht vermieden werden.<br>→ Diese Kosten sind <b>unvermeidbar</b>.</div>kann nicht vermieden werden = unvermeidbar. nicht는 un-으로, können은 -bar로 옮겨요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c75d807b92\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ohne die vielen Helfer wäre der Flohmarkt nie organisiert worden&quot;,&quot;Der Flohmarkt wäre ohne die vielen Helfer nie organisiert worden&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">도와준 많은 사람이 없었다면 그 벼룩시장은 열리지 못했을 거예요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">nie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">vielen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">worden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Flohmarkt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Ohne</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Helfer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">wäre</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">organisiert</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ohne die vielen Helfer wäre der Flohmarkt nie organisiert worden.</b></div>지난 일의 가정 + 수동 → wäre … organisiert worden. worden이 맨 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"1ef49187a8\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) Der Text ist kaum zu verstehen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Die Entscheidung hätte früher getroffen werden gemusst.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Er bekam die Kosten vom Arbeitgeber erstattet.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Die Brücke wäre beinahe gesperrt worden.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">다른 동사와 함께 쓰는 화법조동사는 완료형에서 원형이에요 → hätte getroffen werden müssen.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"0bbb8452cc\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> 'Der Fehler hätte nicht übersehen werden dürfen.'의 뜻은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) 그 실수는 놓쳐서는 안 됐어요.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) 그 실수는 놓쳐도 괜찮았어요.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) 그 실수는 놓칠 수 없었어요.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) 그 실수는 놓치지 않았을 거예요.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">hätte nicht … werden dürfen = ~되어서는 안 됐다. 실제로는 놓쳤다는 뜻이 들어 있어요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"b1fb39762d\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ist&quot;],[&quot;lassen&quot;],[&quot;bekommen&quot;,&quot;erhalten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> Hinweise zur Anmeldung:<br>Das Formular <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(~되어야 한다)</span> vollständig auszufüllen. Fehlende Angaben <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(~될 수 있다)</span> sich später nicht mehr ergänzen. Nach der Anmeldung <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(받다)</span> Sie eine Bestätigung zugeschickt.</div><div class=\"qko\">등록 안내: 신청서는 빠짐없이 작성해야 해요. 빠진 내용은 나중에 채워 넣을 수 없어요. 등록이 끝나면 확인서를 보내 드려요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Hinweise zur Anmeldung:<br>Das Formular <b>ist</b> vollständig auszufüllen. Fehlende Angaben <b>lassen</b> sich später nicht mehr ergänzen. Nach der Anmeldung <b>bekommen</b> Sie eine Bestätigung zugeschickt.</div>ist … auszufüllen = muss ausgefüllt werden · lassen sich … ergänzen = können ergänzt werden · bekommen … zugeschickt는 bekommen 수동이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9aaf9c62d2\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hätten&quot;],[&quot;werden&quot;],[&quot;müssen&quot;,&quot;sollen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Leider hat man die Anwohner nicht rechtzeitig gewarnt.<br>→ Die Anwohner <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(접속법 II)</span> rechtzeitig gewarnt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(수동)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(~야 했다)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">주민들에게 제때 알렸어야 했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Leider hat man die Anwohner nicht rechtzeitig gewarnt.<br>→ Die Anwohner <b>hätten</b> rechtzeitig gewarnt <b>werden</b> <b>müssen</b>.</div>하지 않은 일을 아쉬워할 때 hätte + 과거분사 + werden + müssen을 써요. 주어가 복수라서 hätten이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"f2b3163ca2\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hätte&quot;],[&quot;werden&quot;],[&quot;können&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> Ich bin sicher, dass man das Gebäude hätte retten können.<br>→ Ich bin sicher, dass das Gebäude <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(접속법 II)</span> gerettet <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(수동)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(~수 있었다)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 건물은 분명히 구할 수 있었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich bin sicher, dass man das Gebäude hätte retten können.<br>→ Ich bin sicher, dass das Gebäude <b>hätte</b> gerettet <b>werden</b> <b>können</b>.</div>종속절에서 hätte는 동사 묶음의 맨 앞에 서요 — hätte gerettet werden können.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"175cfcea70\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Sie meint dass der Mietvertrag genauer hätte geprüft werden müssen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 임대 계약서를 더 꼼꼼히 검토했어야 했다고 생각해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">dass</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">hätte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Mietvertrag</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">werden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">meint</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">geprüft</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">genauer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">müssen</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Sie meint, dass der Mietvertrag genauer hätte geprüft werden müssen.</b></div>종속절이지만 hätte가 끝에 가지 않아요. hätte → 과거분사 → werden → müssen 순서예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge plus-badge\">보강</span><span class=\"sub-title\">보강 문제 · 문장을 바꿔 쓰고, 틀린 단어를 찾아요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"9bee83a9bf\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Datei lässt sich nicht speichern.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> 수동문을 sich lassen으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Die Datei kann nicht gespeichert werden.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 31\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Datei lässt sich nicht speichern.</b></div>kann … werden = lässt sich + 원형. 과거분사 gespeichert는 원형 speichern으로 돌아가요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"bb50c9cf91\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe das Paket nach Hause geliefert bekommen.&quot;,&quot;Das Paket habe ich nach Hause geliefert bekommen.&quot;,&quot;Ich habe das Paket nach Hause geliefert gekriegt.&quot;,&quot;Das Paket habe ich nach Hause geliefert gekriegt.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">32.</strong> bekommen 수동으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Man hat mir das Paket nach Hause geliefert.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 32\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe das Paket nach Hause geliefert bekommen.</b></div>3격 mir가 주어 ich가 돼요. 완료형은 habe … geliefert bekommen이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e9edd6208b\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Heizung hätte rechtzeitig repariert werden müssen.&quot;,&quot;Die Heizung hätte rechtzeitig repariert werden sollen.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">33.</strong> '~됐어야 했다'로 바꿔 쓰세요. (hätte … werden müssen)</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Man hat die Heizung nicht rechtzeitig repariert.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 33\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Heizung hätte rechtzeitig repariert werden müssen.</b></div>4격 목적어 die Heizung이 주어가 돼요. nicht는 빠지고, hätte + 과거분사 + werden + müssen을 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4231c92dd8\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"5\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">34.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 차는 하마터면 도둑맞을 뻔했어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">Auto</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">wäre</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">fast</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">gestohlen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">geworden.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Das Auto wäre fast gestohlen worden.</b></div>수동의 완료형에서는 worden을 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"601ad8b254\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"6\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">35.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 옷장은 공구 없이 조립할 수 있어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">Schrank</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">lässt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">sich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">ohne</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">Werkzeug</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">aufgebaut.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Der Schrank lässt sich ohne Werkzeug aufbauen.</b></div>sich lassen 뒤에는 과거분사가 아니라 원형이 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9ef482c189\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"3\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">36.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 글은 연필로 썼어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">Text</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">wurde</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">von</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">einem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">Bleistift</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">geschrieben.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Der Text wurde mit einem Bleistift geschrieben.</b></div>손에 든 도구는 mit + 3격으로 말해요. von은 일을 한 사람에게 써요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"36\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 36</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기